('127.417. d.5.K',4,'A sustainable practice might cost more at first but save money over the building''s:','["paint job", "life cycle", "birthday", "address"]'::jsonb,1,'Life-cycle cost considers long-term savings.','original'),
('127.417. d.6.A',3,'The project manual for a construction job holds the contract conditions, specifications, and the:','["playlists", "lunch menu", "bid documents", "trophies"]'::jsonb,2,'The manual compiles written documents.','original'),
('127.417. d.6.A',4,'Divisions in a project manual group the specifications by trade, such as concrete, metals, and:','["parties", "gossip", "vacations", "finishes"]'::jsonb,3,'Spec divisions follow a standard.','original'),
