('127.417. d.8.A',3,'The Environmental Protection Agency is a federal regulatory agency that sets rules for air, water, and:','["sports", "bakeries", "waste", "music"]'::jsonb,2,'The EPA regulates the environment.','original'),
('127.417. d.8.A',4,'The U.S. Army Corps of Engineers requires a federal permit before a project may place fill in:','["rooftops", "private offices", "parking lots", "wetlands and waters of the U.S."]'::jsonb,3,'Section 404 regulates fill.','original'),
