('127.417. d.9.B',4,'A risk that is unlikely but would be catastrophic, such as a dam failure, still needs a:','["celebration", "mitigation plan", "party", "blank sheet"]'::jsonb,1,'High consequence demands planning.','original'),
('127.417. d.9.C',3,'A job hazard analysis breaks a task into steps, identifies hazards in each step, and lists ways to:','["admire them", "sell them", "control them", "ignore them"]'::jsonb,2,'JHAs reduce hazards.','original'),
